.SS "static int window_trans_update (\fBnoir_sess\fP * ns)\fC [inline, static]\fP"
.PP
update all transparency pixmaps in a window. 
.PP
for now, this will be zero or more of icon-view and shelf, ie whatever is present and uses evas. evas_bg_update() will call \fBbg_upd()\fP if present in the background plug-in; the plug-in may update the background in whatever manner it sees fit. if it supports pseudo-transparency, it may call \fBtransparency_get_pixmap()\fP in evas2.c to obtain a suitable pixmap. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIns\fP - the session
.RE
.PP

